{"id":"n67346-1-14","stage":4,"title":"엄청 · 相当","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67346-1-14-1","ko":"네 친구 중에 개그맨이 있다며?","zh":"听说你朋友里有个搞笑艺人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"개그맨이","meaning":"笑星","explanation":"개그맨：笑星；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개그맨","audio":"/audio/b07d3a21840e35f35a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23756","senseId":"1","lemma":"개그맨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개그맨이","audio":"/audio/bb83e89c4e8236db46bd.mp3"}},{"text":"있다며?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다며","audio":"/audio/11638694e20fa327844f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好